## ⚙️ Installation and Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/pavanijillella-source/Employee-management-application.git
```

### 2. Navigate to the Project Directory

```bash
cd Employee-management-application
```

### 3. Compile the Java Files

Run the following command from the project root directory:

```bash
javac -d . *.java
```

This command compiles the Java source files and generates the required package directories.

### 4. Run the Application

```bash
java com.sj.empmanagmentapplication.Main
```

**Prerequisites:** Install JDK 8 or later and ensure that the package declaration in the Java source files matches `com.sj.empmanagmentapplication`.

